WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.571
Theo: Watch out! The curtain is blowing away.

2
00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:11.676
Riley: Snooks is hiding under the porch.

3
00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:16.728
Sarah: Oh no. Mittens doesn't like to get wet!

4
00:00:16.729 --> 00:00:19.640
Skyler: Neither does Chatter.

5
00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:23.778
Ben: Catch the curtain before it blows away!

6
00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:30.486
Theo: I've got it.

7
00:00:30.487 --> 00:00:33.045
Riley: There's more thunder.

8
00:00:33.046 --> 00:00:41.412
Skyler: Everyone, get inside. Quick!

9
00:00:41.413 --> 00:00:46.285
Riley: Look, the sun is coming out already!

10
00:00:46.286 --> 00:00:48.873
Theo: But it's still raining.

11
00:00:48.874 --> 00:00:53.442
Skyler: I see a rainbow!

12
00:00:53.443 --> 00:00:57.436
Chatter: Pretty rainbow!

13
00:00:57.437 --> 00:00:59.852
Sarah: A rainbow!

14
00:00:59.853 --> 00:01:03.291
Riley: Let's all make a wish.

15
00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:05.200
Skyler: Close your eyes!

16
00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:14.119
Ben: And don't tell anyone your wish.

17
00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.693
Here I come, Speedy.

18
00:01:15.694 --> 00:01:18.676
The storm is over. Skyler:

19
00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:23.740
And so is our pet show.

20
00:01:23.741 --> 00:01:28.007
Boy: That was a great show!

21
00:01:28.008 --> 00:01:31.786
Girl: Look, your turtle is hiding.

22
00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:35.554
Ben: Yep. Speedy always hides inside his shell.

23
00:01:35.555 --> 00:01:38.592
Skyler: He's very good at hiding.

24
00:01:38.593 --> 00:01:42.315
Girl: I wish I could hide like that.

25
00:01:42.316 --> 00:01:47.070
Theo: Yeah, when it's time for a test at school!

26
00:01:47.071 --> 00:01:51.295
Riley: Or when we're having peas for dinner!

27
00:01:51.296 --> 00:01:57.584
Kelli: Or when my mom says, "Clean up your room."

28
00:01:57.585 --> 00:01:59.931
Ben: Speedy's shell protects him.

29
00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:02.955
Today it protected him from the storm.

30
00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:06.821
Boy: That's an amazing trick.

31
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:10.077
Theo: It sure is.

32
00:02:10.078 --> 00:02:12.999
Ben: I wished that Speedy could do a great trick.

33
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.499
But he already knew one!

